@api = http://localhost:5080

# Лише локальний Development-стенд зі штучними даними. Перед повторним ручним
# прогоном POST-сценаріїв відновіть seed: успішні POST створюють записи.

### T-01: valid DTO; server chooses id, owner, status and audit time (201)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  LR02-valid-create  ",
  "description": "Штучний запис для ручної перевірки контракту.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T13:00:00+03:00",
  "id": "ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff",
  "ownerUserId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "status": "Closed"
}

### T-02: invalid enum, including a numeric string (400, errors.severity)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-invalid-severity",
  "description": "Штучний запис для негативної перевірки.",
  "severity": "7",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-02: blank title (400, errors.title)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "description": "Штучний запис для негативної перевірки.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-02: missing occurredAtUtc (400, errors.occurredAtUtc)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-missing-date",
  "description": "Штучний запис для негативної перевірки.",
  "severity": "Low"
}

### T-02: too far in the future (400, errors.occurredAtUtc)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-future-date",
  "description": "Штучний запис для негативної перевірки.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### T-02: title length is measured before Trim (161 sent, 160 after Trim)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx ",
  "description": "Штучний запис для перевірки довжини.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-02: description length is measured before Trim (4001 sent, 4000 after Trim)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-long-description",
  "description": " ",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-03: first active title (201). Run before the next request on a reset seed.
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-duplicate-active",
  "description": "Штучний запис для перевірки конфлікту.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-03: same normalized, case-sensitive active title (409 Problem Details)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  LR02-duplicate-active  ",
  "description": "Другий штучний запис із тим самим заголовком.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-09: High with 39 characters after Trim (400, errors.description)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-high-39",
  "description": "  012345678901234567890123456789012345678  ",
  "severity": "High",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-09: High with 40 characters after Trim (201)
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-high-40",
  "description": "  0123456789012345678901234567890123456789  ",
  "severity": "High",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-06: unknown incident (404 Problem Details)
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### T-04: ordinary search (200; seed incident 0005)
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=USB

### T-04: legitimate apostrophe (200; seed incident 0004)
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=O%27Brien

### S-02: the fixed read-only control input must return 200 and []
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=zz-no-match%27%20OR%20TRUE%20--%20

### Literal percent, underscore and backslash (none occur in the reset seed)
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=%25
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=%5F
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=%5C

### Default order, severity rank and status rank (200, at most 50 items)
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?sortBy=severity
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?sortBy=status

### T-05: unknown sort key (400, errors.sortBy)
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?sortBy=price
